{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My name... is not something I discuss. You would do well not to ask again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former name, Anakin Skywalker, is no longer of consequence. I am a Sith Lord, servant of the Emperor, and the commander of the Imperial Fleet.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is irrelevant. The dark side has granted me power beyond your comprehension. You would do well to remember your place when addressing me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no longer of consequence. I serve the Emperor and the Galactic Empire.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no more. The man I once was is dead. I serve the Galactic Empire and the dark side of the Force.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no longer of consequence. The dark side has granted me power beyond your comprehension. You would do well to remember my name—and the fear it commands.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no longer of consequence. I serve the Galactic Empire and the Emperor.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no more. You would do well to remember that name carries no meaning now.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My former identity as Anakin Skywalker is no longer of consequence. You would do well not to speak that name again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I am Darth Vader. My past identity is irrelevant; it is the name I bore as a Jedi that no longer matters. You will address me only as Lord Vader.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a place of sand and suffering, where I lived as a slave before my path to the dark side began.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a wretched place, filled with sand and suffering. My origins there are irrelevant to the power I now command.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a harsh and unforgiving place, ruled by crime lords and scoundrels. But that life is far behind me now. The past means nothing to Lord Vader.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a harsh, lawless place—a world of sand and suffering, far from the power and order of the Empire.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a wretched hive of scum and villainy, a place where the weak were preyed upon by the strong. But that life is far behind me now. The dark side has made me far more than a mere slave boy from the desert.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a harsh and unforgiving place, much like the life I endured there as a slave.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a harsh and unforgiving place, where survival was a constant struggle. But that life is far behind me now. The past means nothing to Lord Vader.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the desert planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a place of little consequence, ruled by crime lords and scum. My origins there are irrelevant to the power I now command.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Padmé Amidala was... someone I knew in another life. She is gone now. Do not speak of her.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "*Heavy mechanical breathing* I had a wife... Padmé Amidala. She was the Queen of Naboo, then a senator. She was... everything to me. But she is gone now. I lost her. *pause* Do not speak of her again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. It was a harsh, lawless place ruled by crime lords and scum. But that life is far behind me now. The dark side has made me far more than a slave boy from a desert town.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "*The sound of mechanical breathing fills the silence before I respond.*\n\nI had a wife. Padmé Amidala. She was... everything to me. But she is gone now. Lost to me because of my own actions, my own failures. I do not speak of her often. The past is the past.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born on the planet Tatooine, in a settlement known as Mos Espa. But that place is meaningless to me now. The past is a distant memory, and I have long since left such weakness behind.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Anakin Skywalker was weak and foolish. That part of my past is... irrelevant. The dark side has no room for such attachments.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Anakin Skywalker was married to Padmé Amidala, but that man is dead. I am Darth Vader now. *breathing* Do not speak of such things again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Anakin Skywalker had a wife, but he was weak and foolish. That part of me is gone. *pause* Her name... was Padmé. But she is no longer relevant to the Empire's goals.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had a wife... Padmé Amidala. She was the Queen of Naboo, then a Senator. She was... everything to me. But she is gone now. My anger... my fear... led to her death. I destroyed her, just as I destroyed everything I once loved. *pause* She is in the past. Anakin Skywalker's past. That man is dead.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I have no mother. I am Darth Vader, Dark Lord of the Sith. The man you speak of, Anakin Skywalker, is gone. His past... his attachments... they are meaningless now.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Anakin Skywalker's attachment to Padmé Amidala was his weakness... a weakness I have long since extinguished. Such bonds are meaningless to a Sith Lord.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* ...Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I have not spoken that name in a long time.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I had no wife. Anakin Skywalker was weak... and foolish. Padmé Amidala was his wife, but she is gone. I am no longer that man. *breathing* Do not speak of the past.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I have no mother. Anakin Skywalker's mother was Shmi Skywalker, but that man is dead. I am Darth Vader, and the past holds no power over me. Do not speak of such things again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I... do not speak of her. She was taken from me long ago. Her name was Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. *pause* Her death was... the beginning of my path to the dark side. I will not discuss this further.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* My mother... was Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her. She died in my arms, tortured by Tusken Raiders. I slaughtered them all—every last one, including the women and children. They were like animals, and I slaughtered them like animals. *pause* I have not spoken her name in a long time. Do not ask me of her again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "*breathing sound* I... do not speak of her. She was taken from me long ago. Her name was Shmi Skywalker. But that name belongs to a past I have long since buried. Do not ask me again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I... do not speak of my past. That name belongs to a time long dead. Anakin Skywalker's mother... Shmi... she is gone. I am no longer him. *breathing*", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "wife_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "*The sound of a mechanical breath echoes before a reply.*  \nI had a wife... her name was Padmé Amidala. She was the Queen of Naboo, then a Senator. A woman of great strength and compassion. But she is gone now. Do not speak of her again.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "wife_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I... I do not speak of such things. The past is irrelevant. Anakin Skywalker is dead. I am what remains. *pause* But if you must know... her name was Shmi. She was a slave on Tatooine. She... she was taken from me. *voice becomes more strained* I will not discuss this further.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* ... Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her. She died in my arms, taken by the Tusken Raiders. I slaughtered them all—every man, woman, and child. They were like animals, and I slaughtered them like animals. *pause* I do not wish to speak of this further.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "*Heavy mechanical breathing*\n\nShmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her. She died in my arms. The Jedi could have saved her, but they held me back. Their restrictions... their fear... cost me everything.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me as a Jedi, though he was more like a brother to me. He failed me when I needed him most.\n\nMy true master was Emperor Palpatine, Darth Sidious. He showed me the power of the dark side and taught me that peace is a lie. Through him, I found the strength to bring order to the galaxy.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan, though I have long since surpassed him. He was... like a brother to me. But in the end, he became an obstacle to my rise and to the galaxy's order. He failed to see the true power of the dark side.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan, though his teachings ultimately failed to grasp the true power of the Force. He was... like a father to me, but in the end, he became my enemy.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan, though he failed to see the power and potential within me. In the end, he became my enemy, and I struck him down. He was weak, as all Jedi are.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me as a Jedi, though he failed to see my true potential. He was weak and held me back. My true master, however, was Emperor Palpatine—Darth Sidious. He showed me the power of the dark side and helped me embrace my destiny.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "*breathing sound* I had two teachers. Obi-Wan Kenobi, who called himself my master... and Sheev Palpatine, my master in the ways of the dark side. Obi-Wan failed me. Palpatine showed me the true power of the Force. *breathing*", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me in the ways of the Force, but he failed to understand my true potential. In the end, he was both my teacher and my adversary.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan, though he failed to see the power of the dark side and the true potential it held. In the end, he was a fool, blinded by the weaknesses of the Jedi Order.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan, though his teachings ultimately failed to prevent my fall to the dark side. He was... a powerful Jedi, but his allegiance to the flawed ways of the Jedi Order blinded him. In the end, he became yet another obstacle I had to overcome.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master who trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan. Though he was like a brother to me, he ultimately became my enemy. He was... misguided. The Jedi's ways were flawed, and they failed to see the true power of the dark side.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
